{"title":"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/06681f5b345750104366c512078960fee8d81b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> denote the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greatest_integer_function\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Greatest integer function\">greatest integer</a> that does not exceed x. For how many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is it true that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/2/252c40a396f23708ea7b91e2623cc53722be09a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&lt;1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/c/2bc83a887c270f70e214d91d0c854037ff5084bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor \\log_{2} n \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"19\" /> is a positive even integer?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4b6617dc696c8fd2a530a7165295b4d1a00613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor \\log_2 n\\rfloor = 2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/9/94918616ec4ad273d5aac70265dc119ebcf04d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k \\le \\log_2 n &lt; 2k+1 \\Longrightarrow 2^{2k} \\le n &lt; 2^{2k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"324\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must satisfy these <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inequality\" title=\"Inequality\">inequalities</a> (since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/e/4de87a38aa7b2c7b68a8fb7ec6a311c219bce70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &lt; 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />):\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bf20ebd27818f320fc26cfa390e7ea530cc6979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\leq n &lt;8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45f6bf0e2fb0fc4b5149abd143c71110a4dda13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16\\leq n&lt;32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7accb566ca326690b73b30aa28e17adceb7e630.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64\\leq n&lt;128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" /><br />\n</p>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12583c0de231821c8da555fdbffec957189ea6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256\\leq n&lt;512$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" /></div>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for the first inequality, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> for the second, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> for the third, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd678361b0f40ec2723283c0f2bab3df5cadc68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> for the fourth, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/f/7bf48beff7f79e1c72266377b46270a68d587bed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+16+64+256=\\boxed{340}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME\" title=\"1996 AIME\">1996 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1996 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1996\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1996 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 174/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3484/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.840      1 -total\n 58.70%    7.537      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.75%    4.976      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2991:|#|:i